"Play sound from mirrored devices" = "播放投屏设备的声音";
"Volume follows the mirroring device; adjust it there." = "音量跟随投屏设备；在设备上调节即可。";
"Open iMirror at login" = "登录时打开 iMirror";
"A new four-digit code is generated each time a new device pairs; no fixed code is stored. Verified devices can reconnect without a code." = "每次有新设备配对时都会生成新的四位验证码，不会保存固定验证码。已验证的设备再次连接时无需验证码。";
"Forget All Devices…" = "忘记所有设备…";
"Reset Receiver Identity…" = "重置接收器身份…";
"After a reset, every device must verify again." = "重置后，所有设备都需要重新验证。";
"Forget all paired devices?" = "要忘记所有已配对的设备吗？";
"Forget All Devices" = "忘记所有设备";
"Each device will need a new code the next time it mirrors to this Mac." = "下次投屏到这台 Mac 时，每台设备都需要输入新的验证码。";
"Reset the receiver identity?" = "要重置接收器身份吗？";
"Reset and Restart" = "重置并重启";
"The receiver restarts, current mirroring stops and every device must verify again. This can’t be undone." = "接收器会重新启动，当前投屏会停止，所有设备都需要重新验证。此操作无法撤销。";
"Cancel" = "取消";

/* Getting started guide */
"Welcome to iMirror" = "欢迎使用 iMirror";
"Mirror an iPhone, iPad or another Mac to this Mac" = "把 iPhone、iPad 或另一台 Mac 的屏幕投到这台 Mac 上";
"iMirror lives in the menu bar" = "iMirror 在菜单栏里";
"Click %@ in the menu bar for status and settings. iMirror has no Dock icon; that’s expected." = "点按菜单栏中的 %@ 查看状态和设置。iMirror 没有 Dock 图标，这是正常的。";
"Open Screen Mirroring on your iPhone or iPad" = "在 iPhone 或 iPad 上打开“屏幕镜像”";
"Swipe down from the top-right corner to open Control Center, then tap Screen Mirroring. On a Mac, use Control Center in the menu bar." = "从屏幕右上角向下轻扫打开控制中心，然后轻点“屏幕镜像”。在 Mac 上，请使用菜单栏中的控制中心。";
"Choose “%@”" = "选择“%@”";
"The device and this Mac must be on the same Wi-Fi network. If macOS asks whether iMirror may access the local network, click Allow." = "设备和这台 Mac 需要连接同一个 Wi-Fi 网络。如果 macOS 询问是否允许 iMirror 访问本地网络，请点按“允许”。";
"Enter the code the first time" = "第一次连接时输入验证码";
"A four-digit code appears on this Mac; enter it on the device. The same device won’t need a code again." = "这台 Mac 上会显示四位验证码，在设备上输入即可。同一台设备之后再连接不需要验证码。";
"Use the mirroring window" = "使用投屏窗口";
"Move the pointer over the picture to show the stop, pin and full-screen buttons in the top-left corner, or press Command-W to stop and Control-Command-F for full screen. Sound from the device plays on this Mac." = "把指针移到画面上，左上角会显示停止、置顶和全屏幕按钮；也可以按 Command-W 停止，按 Control-Command-F 切换全屏幕。设备的声音会从这台 Mac 播放。";
"Get Started" = "开始使用";
"You can show this guide again any time from the iMirror menu." = "随时可以从 iMirror 菜单再次打开本指南。";

/* Mirroring window */
"Unpin" = "取消置顶";
"Keep on Top" = "保持置顶";

